### Organizador: registro
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register-organizador
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=limite

--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="nombreOrganizacion"

Organizacion de Prueba
--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="rut"

211234560018
--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="departamento"

Cerro Largo
--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

organizador.prueba@gmail.com
--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="telefono"

099123456
--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="password"

Clave1234
--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fotoCedulaFrente"; filename="frente.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./frente.png
--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fotoCedulaDorso"; filename="dorso.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./dorso.png
--limite--

### Organizador: login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=organizador.prueba@gmail.com&password=Clave1234